  - key: Finding Sir Ragnar
    trigger: 7
    roomId: 
    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: When Sir Ragnar is found, an alarm sounds. Use the plastic Dread
      sorcerer figure to represent Sir Ragnar on the board. Place all remaining monsters,
      doors, and furniture on the board. All doors are now open. Sir Ragnar should
      be moved by the hero who opened the door to his cell. (Heroes cannot search
      for treasure in the cell.) That hero takes their regular turn first, then rolls
      1 red die to move the wounded knight. Sir Ragnar must be moved back to the
      stairs alive in order for the heroes to collect the reward (see parchment text
      above). Sir Ragnar may not attack but may roll 2 Defend dice. He has 2 Body
      Points left.
    requiresDeadGroup: 
